*     FAP                                                                       
       LBL     MTAN                                                     MTAN0000
       COUNT   30                                                       MTAN0001
*      ROUTINE TO MODIFY ACCURACY TEST OF U. OF CHICAGO TANGENT         MTAN0002
*           1. CALLING SEQUENCE IN FORTRAN     CALL  MTAN(K)            MTAN0003
*              THIS PROGRAM IS NOT DESIGNED FOR FAP USERS.              MTAN0004
*           2. STANDARD MINIMUM ACCURACY GUARANTEE OF U.C. TAN IS 1/3.  MTAN0005
*              WITH EXECUTION OF ABOVE CALLING SEQUENCE WITH K=0,1,2,3, MTAN0006
*                4 OR 5, U.C. TAN CIRCUIT IS MODIFIED TO GIVE MINIMUM   MTAN0007
*                ACCURACY GUARANTEE OF 1/(2**(K+2)-1)                   MTAN0008
*              WITH EXECUTION OF ABOVE CALLING SEQUENCE WITH K GREATER  MTAN0009
*                THAN 5, U.C. TAN CIRCUIT IS MODIFIED TO SUSPEND ABOVE  MTAN0010
*                ACCURACY GUARANTEE FEATURE COMPLETELY SO THAT ANY ARG  MTAN0011
*                LESS THAN 2**20 IN ABSOLUTE VALUE WILL BE ACCEPTED.    MTAN0012
       ENTRY   MTAN                                                     MTAN0013
 MTAN  CAL*    1,4           DECREMENT SHOULD HAVE K, THE REST CLEAR    MTAN0014
       CAS     K1                                                       MTAN0015
       ZAC                     K IS GREATER THAN 5                      MTAN0016
       TRA     MT1                                                      MTAN0017
       ARS     18              K IS UP TO 5                             MTAN0018
       STA     *+2                                                      MTAN0019
       CLA     K3                                                       MTAN0020
       ALS     **                                                       MTAN0021
  MT1  STO*    $CRIT                                                    MTAN0022
       TRA     2,4                                                      MTAN0023
       SPACE                                                            MTAN0024
  K1   OCT     5400000                                                  MTAN0025
  K3   OCT     1                                                        MTAN0026
       END                                                              MTAN0027
